    "text": "\n L=3^k,\\quad U=2^A,\\quad\n C=\\sum_{j=0}^{k-1}3^{k-1-j}2^{A_j},\\quad\n f_w(n)=(Ln+C)/U.\n\\tag{2}\n"
  },
  {
    "kind": "DisplayMath",
    "text": "\n \\rho+2Ut\\longmapsto\\eta+2Lt,\\qquad t\\ge0,\n\\quad \\rho\\equiv(U-C)L^{-1}\\pmod{2U},\\quad0<\\rho<2U,\n\\quad\\eta=(L\\rho+C)/U.\n\\tag{3}\n"
  },
  {
    "kind": "DisplayMath",
