    "text": "\n v_0=1+2\\,4^{b-1}n/3^{b-1}.\n"
  },
  {
    "kind": "DisplayMath",
    "text": "\n v_j=1+2\\,4^{b-1-j}n/3^{b-1-j}\\quad(0\\le j\\le b-1).\n\\tag{16}\n"
