    "text": "\n n(t)=8808219+17006112t,\\qquad\n m(t)=8689663+16777216t,\n\\tag{21}\n"
  },
  {
    "kind": "DisplayMath",
    "text": "\n J^{\\rm old}_{b,e}=2^{e+2b},\\quad\n J^{\\rm old}_{b,e}(n/3^b)+h_e=0\\pmod{3^{a^{\\rm old}(b,e)}},\n \\quad n=3\\pmod4,\n\\tag{22}\n"
  },
  {
