    "text": "\n d_\\epsilon H=I-Q,\\quad Q^2=Q,\\quad HQ=0,\n \\quad d_\\epsilon F=Qd_\\epsilon,\\quad F^2=F,\\quad FH=0.\n\\tag{39}\n"
  },
  {
